    "description": "<p><strong>Once per session</strong>, you may <strong>spend a Hope</strong> and explain with some technical and incomprehensible words why something that just happened isn't quite possible. Then do one of the following:</p><ul><li><p>Avoid marking a Hit Point, Stress or Armor Slot.</p></li><li><p>Add or substract 2 from any roll (include adversaries).</p></li></ul><p>After the first time you use this feature during a session and <strong>once per scene</strong>, you can use Ingenuity by <strong>giving the GM a Fear</strong> instead of spending a Hope.</p>",
